The Compelled was the patron deity of the [[Geography/Raelion/index|Raelion]] Empire but is now worshipped by the few Raelish refugees on the continent. His teachings focus on a form of predestination -- that all have an ideal life, and it's a follower's utmost responsibility to reach that ideal. The Compelled also emphasizes both meritocratic hierarchies and respect for those higher than oneself in said hierarchy.

:::deity[The Compelled]{category="Outer God"}
Edicts :: Achieve your best self, work hard, and demand others do as well
Anathema :: Disobey a superior, shirk your duties
[[Divine Raiment]] :: Silver, matte
[[Celestial Prescence]] :: Meteor shower

### Devotee Benefits
Divine Ability :: Intelligence or Dexterity
Divine Font :: harm or heal
Divine Sanctification :: can choose holy or unholy
Divine Skill :: Arcana
Favored Weapon :: [whip](https://2e.aonprd.com/Weapons.aspx?ID=404)
Domains :: [fate](https://2e.aonprd.com/Domains.aspx?ID=75), [glyph](https://2e.aonprd.com/Domains.aspx?ID=109), [introspection](https://2e.aonprd.com/Domains.aspx?ID=110), [luck](https://2e.aonprd.com/Domains.aspx?ID=81), [magic](https://2e.aonprd.com/Domains.aspx?ID=82), [perfection](https://2e.aonprd.com/Domains.aspx?ID=89)
Cleric Spells :: 1st: [message rune](https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=2356), 3rd: [secret page](https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=270), 6th: [never mind](https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1614)
:::
